{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mathletics is a fast-paced math game about collecting values to stay within whatever range you set. Add, subtract, and strategize your way through handmade math-based puzzles in the campaign, or brave different 'Events' and 'Powerups' as long as you can in 'Endless'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 handmade levels across 5 themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Endless' mode, where you collect numbers until you make a mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerups and Events inspired by school supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable game settings so you can decide how you want to play</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741560?t=1747578949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741560?t=1747578949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741560/50a7242c807399f093dfe64c59d16e75050953d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747578949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741560/50a7242c807399f093dfe64c59d16e75050953d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747578949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mathletics is a fast-paced math game about collecting values to stay within whatever range you set. Add, subtract, and strategize your way through handmade math-based puzzles in the campaign, or brave different 'Events' and 'Powerups' as long as you can in 'Endless'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 handmade lev